# The NVIDIA SkillSpector release that scripts/skill-scan.sh installs, for the
# scan of skills/. SkillSpector is not on PyPI: it installs from its git repo.
# tag v2.13.4 (published 2026-11-04); the commit is the pin, a tag can move.
# Its uv.lock holds a hash for each dependency, and the script installs with
# --frozen, so nothing resolves at install time.
# Keep it at least 7 days old.
